⭐ Pattern Printing — Stars & Pyramid

A beginner-friendly Python program that prints different star patterns using nested for loops.
The program allows the user to choose between a left-aligned triangle and a centered pyramid, and it can continue generating patterns until the user enters q.

📌 Features
⭐ Prints a left-aligned star triangle
🔺 Prints a centered pyramid
🔢 Allows the user to choose the number of rows
🎯 Allows the user to choose the pattern
🔄 Supports multiple pattern generations
🚪 Allows the user to quit using q


